# Normalize line endings in the repo, independent of each contributor's local
# core.autocrlf (that is a per-machine Git setting, not a repo guarantee). Store
# everything LF; auto-detected binaries are left untouched. This also keeps the
# CMake amalgamator's generated dist/ headers stable: it writes the host OS's
# native newline, and this pins the committed form to LF on Windows and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
